.IX Title "LEI-RM-WATCH 1"
.TH LEI-RM-WATCH 1 1993-10-02 public-inbox.git "public-inbox user manual"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lei\-rm\-watch \- stop watching locations
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
lei rm\-watch [OPTIONS] LOCATION [LOCATION...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Tell lei to stop watching \f(CW\*(C`LOCATION\*(C'\fR for new messages and flag
changes.  Currently only Maildir locations are supported.
.SH CONTACT
.IX Header "CONTACT"
Feedback welcome via plain\-text mail to <mailto:meta@public\-inbox.org>
.PP
